        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Adam tarou jingmei rui kham,",
            "Mei guai jaipat khang thou guang nicho?",
            "Kaniu lung geimei 6$% ti nchu khang,",
            "Kaniu jang khou thei khang,",
            "Tingkau Laujiu Nah puan.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "Hallelujah neilana thuan ku o,",
            "Kau Guang Jubili 6$%;",
            "Bethlehem le Kalvari ching ru khou,",
            "Kanloumeipu sianmiu khuang.",
            "",
            "2. Salem bang khou misor namdai,",
            "Kata kanloumei sianmiu khuang;",
            "Nangniu kang rui tingkkau Laujiu Nah,",
            "Jei hang rui karuna,",
            "Hou mumei namdai khou.",
            "",
            "3. Thei thang hou mumei rih thao e,",
            "Pap rui nang bumang gumliam louna;",
            "Jeho-Jerie ching ru khou guanga,",
            "Hosanna sin guanga,",
            "Salem chuangphei bang khou.",
            "",
            "4. Salem chuangphei bang khou ringmei,",
            "Salem poubaumei rui suaihiammei;",
            "Jeho-Jerie ching khou bammei guaiRui lai ngam puni e,",
            "Hallelujah Amen."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
